@startuml
title Admin przegląda konta systemowe
autonumber

actor Admin
boundary AdminSystemAccountsController as Controller
control AdminSystemAccountService as Service
database Db

Admin -> Controller : GET /api/admin/system-accounts
Controller -> Service : GetAccountsAsync
Service -> Db : RateSourceSystem i PlatformTreasury
Service -> Db : portfele i powiązane RateSource
Service --> Controller : DTO kont i sald
Controller --> Admin : 200 OK

note right of Service
Operacja tylko do odczytu.
end note
@enduml
